@startuml MyBatis-XML-Config-Parsing流程
title MyBatis XML配置文件解析时序图
hide footbox

actor 开发者 as User
participant ":XMLConfigBuilder" as ConfigBuilder
participant ":Configuration" as Config
participant ":TypeAliasRegistry" as TypeAliasRegistry
participant ":InterceptorChain" as InterceptorChain
participant ":TransactionFactory" as TransFactory
participant ":DataSourceFactory" as DSFactory
participant ":Environment" as Environment
participant ":XMLMapperBuilder" as MapperBuilder
participant ":XMLStatementBuilder" as StatementBuilder
participant ":MapperBuilderAssistant" as Assistant
participant ":MapperAnnotationBuilder" as AnnotationBuilder

== 1. XMLConfigBuilder.parse() ==

User -> ConfigBuilder: parse()
activate ConfigBuilder
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: parser.evalNode("/configuration")
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: parseConfiguration(root)

ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: propertiesElement(root.evalNode("properties"))
ConfigBuilder -> Config: setVariables(props)

ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: settingsAsProperties(root.evalNode("settings"))
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: loadCustomVfs()/loadCustomLogImpl()
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: settingsElement(settings)
note right of Config
  这里会设置 cacheEnabled、defaultExecutorType、
  mapUnderscoreToCamelCase、localCacheScope 等配置
end note

ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: typeAliasesElement(root.evalNode("typeAliases"))
ConfigBuilder -> TypeAliasRegistry: registerAlias(...)

ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: pluginElement(root.evalNode("plugins"))
ConfigBuilder -> InterceptorChain: addInterceptor(interceptor)

ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: objectFactoryElement(...)
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: objectWrapperFactoryElement(...)
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: reflectorFactoryElement(...)

ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: environmentsElement(root.evalNode("environments"))
ConfigBuilder -> TransFactory: transactionManagerElement(...)
ConfigBuilder -> DSFactory: dataSourceElement(...)
ConfigBuilder -> Environment: new Environment.Builder(...).build()
ConfigBuilder -> Config: setEnvironment(environment)

ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: databaseIdProviderElement(root.evalNode("databaseIdProvider"))
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: typeHandlerElement(root.evalNode("typeHandlers"))
ConfigBuilder -> ConfigBuilder: mapperElement(root.evalNode("mappers"))

== 2. Mapper 加载方式 ==

alt package 方式
  ConfigBuilder -> Config: addMappers(packageName)
else resource/url 方式
  ConfigBuilder -> MapperBuilder: new XMLMapperBuilder(inputStream, configuration, resourceOrUrl, sqlFragments)
  activate MapperBuilder
  MapperBuilder -> MapperBuilder: parse()
  MapperBuilder -> MapperBuilder: configurationElement(/mapper)
  MapperBuilder -> Assistant: cacheRefElement()/cacheElement()
  MapperBuilder -> Assistant: resultMapElements(...)
  MapperBuilder -> MapperBuilder: sqlElement(...)
  MapperBuilder -> StatementBuilder: parseStatementNode()
  activate StatementBuilder
  StatementBuilder -> StatementBuilder: applyIncludes(context.getNode())
  StatementBuilder -> StatementBuilder: processSelectKeyNodes(...)
  StatementBuilder -> StatementBuilder: langDriver.createSqlSource(...)
  StatementBuilder -> Assistant: addMappedStatement(...)
  deactivate StatementBuilder
  MapperBuilder -> MapperBuilder: parsePendingResultMaps()/parsePendingCacheRefs()/parsePendingStatements()
  MapperBuilder -> MapperBuilder: bindMapperForNamespace()
  deactivate MapperBuilder
else class 方式
  ConfigBuilder -> Config: addMapper(mapperInterface)
  Config -> AnnotationBuilder: parse()
end

ConfigBuilder --> User: Configuration
deactivate ConfigBuilder

note over User
  解析顺序以 XMLConfigBuilder.parseConfiguration() 为准:
  properties -> settings -> typeAliases -> plugins
  -> objectFactory/objectWrapperFactory/reflectorFactory
  -> environments -> databaseIdProvider -> typeHandlers -> mappers
end note

@enduml